---
/**
 * Homepage FAQ, Q.01 only ("How much does this cost?").
 *
 * Spec ref: docs/design/S6_PLUS.md Section 9 (~line 792).
 * Locked copy from spec line 198. Anchors against $5k national /
 * $2.5k freelancer competitor pricing; Winters Code starter ~$1,750.
 */
---

<section class="faq-q1" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq1-q">
  <header class="fq-head">
    <div class="fq-eyebrow">
      <span class="line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <h2 class="fq-h">05 · QUESTION</h2>
      <span class="fq-status">the first one everyone asks</span>
    </div>
    <a href="/services#faq" class="fq-link">more questions →</a>
  </header>

  <article class="fq-card">
    <p class="fq-q-num">Q.01</p>
    <h3 class="fq-q" id="faq1-q">How much does this cost?</h3>
    <p class="fq-a">
      Agency quality, priced under a freelancer. National agencies typically start at
      <span class="strike">$5,000+</span> and run 6+ weeks. Hourly
      freelancers often bill <span class="strike">$2,500+</span> over a
      month. A starter site with me starts around <strong>$1,750</strong>, live in
      days. <em>Free consult, custom quote. I can steer it start to finish, or
      you can co-pilot with me.</em>
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="fq-cta">Free consult →</a>
  </article>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-q1 {
    padding: 40px 4px 48px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 740px) {
    .faq-q1 { padding: 56px 4px 64px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .faq-q1 { padding: 72px 0 80px; }
  }

  .fq-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--copper-hairline);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .fq-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .fq-eyebrow .line {
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-copper);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .fq-eyebrow .line { width: 40px; } }
  .fq-h {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--color-copper);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .fq-h { font-size: 13px; } }
  .fq-status {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ash-500);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .fq-link {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-ash-400);
    transition: color 200ms;
  }
  .fq-link:hover { color: var(--color-wc-green); }

  /* ─── Card ─── */
  .fq-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--copper-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-large);
    padding: 24px 22px 26px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .fq-card { padding: 32px 36px 36px; }
  }

  .fq-q-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-copper);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .fq-q {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  @media (min-width: 740px) { .fq-q { font-size: 28px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .fq-q { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 20px; } }

  .fq-a {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ash-300);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .fq-a { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; } }

  .fq-a em {
    color: var(--color-wc-green);
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .fq-a .strike {
    color: var(--color-ash-500);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(220, 80, 80, 0.5);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .fq-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    background: var(--color-wc-green);
    color: var(--color-bg-deep);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 200ms, transform 200ms;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .fq-cta:hover {
    background: var(--color-wc-green-bright);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
</style>
